---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
import InquiryForm from '@/components/InquiryForm.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Us - Wood Slab Shop" description="Get in touch with Wood Slab Shop. Ask about a specific slab, request custom milling, or inquire about wholesale pricing.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="lg:col-span-1">
            <header class="mb-8">
              <h1 id="contact-heading" class="font-display font-medium text-display-lg text-slate-900 mb-4">
                Get In Touch
              </h1>
              <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Have questions about a slab? Need custom dimensions? Want to visit our yard? We'd love to hear from you.
              </p>
            </header>

            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-wood-50 border border-wood-200">
                <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-lg text-slate-900 mb-3">Visit Our Yard</h3>
                <address class="not-italic text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                  <p>123 Timber Lane</p>
                  <p>Portland, OR 97201</p>
                  <p>By appointment only</p>
                </address>
              </div>

              <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-wood-50 border border-wood-200">
                <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-lg text-slate-900 mb-3">Call Us</h3>
                <address class="not-italic text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                  <a href="tel:+15035550123" class="hover:text-wood-700 transition-colors">(503) 555-0123</a>
                  <p class="text-sm">Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm PST</p>
                </address>
              </div>

              <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-wood-50 border border-wood-200">
                <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-lg text-slate-900 mb-3">Email Us</h3>
                <address class="not-italic text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                  <a href="mailto:hello@woodslabshop.com" class="hover:text-wood-700 transition-colors">hello@woodslabshop.com</a>
                  <p class="text-sm">We respond within 24 hours</p>
                </address>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-2">
            <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
              <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-xl text-slate-900 mb-6">Send a Message</h2>
              <InquiryForm />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-wood-50" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <header class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 lg:mb-16">
          <h2 id="faq-heading" class="font-display font-medium text-display-lg text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Frequently Asked Questions
          </h2>
        </header>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">Do you ship slabs?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>Yes, we ship throughout the US and Canada. Shipping is calculated based on dimensions, weight, and destination. We crate each slab custom for safe transit. Freight shipping typically ranges from $200–$800 depending on size and location.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">Can I visit and hand-pick a slab?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>Absolutely! We encourage it. Our yard is open by appointment Monday–Friday. Seeing the grain, color, and figure in person makes a huge difference. Schedule a visit via the contact form or call us.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">What does "kiln-dried" mean?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>Kiln drying reduces moisture content to 6–8% in a controlled environment. This prevents warping, cracking, and movement after you build with it. Air-dried slabs can take years to reach this stability; kiln drying accomplishes it in weeks with precise control.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">Do you offer custom milling or surfacing?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>We can surface plane, straight-line rip, or cut to rough dimensions for a fee. We don't do finish milling (final thickness, joinery, etc.)—that's best done in your shop after the slab acclimates. Contact us for a quote on prep work.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">What payment methods do you accept?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>We accept credit cards (via Stripe), bank transfers, and checks. For slabs over $2,000, we require a 50% deposit to hold the slab, with balance due before pickup or shipment. Payment links are sent via email.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-wood-200 overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900">What if a slab has defects?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-wood-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-600 border-t border-wood-200">
              <p>We document all known defects (checks, knots, bark inclusions, etc.) in the description and photos. Natural character is part of the appeal. If you receive a slab with undisclosed structural defects, contact us within 48 hours for a return or credit.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>